@host = http://localhost:5109

### List canonical unit names
GET {{host}}/api/v1/units

### Convert 100 meters to feet
GET {{host}}/api/v1/conversions?value=100&from=meter&to=foot

### Convert boiling water to Fahrenheit
GET {{host}}/api/v1/conversions?value=100&from=celsius&to=fahrenheit

### Unknown unit
GET {{host}}/api/v1/conversions?value=1&from=furlong&to=meter

### Incompatible categories
GET {{host}}/api/v1/conversions?value=1&from=meter&to=kilogram
